      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's acute pulmonary oedema, and we'll know more once the blood tests is back. I think blood tests makes sense here, for pulmonary oedema. I'm prescribing furosemide, 40 milligrams, once now, single dose. It's for fluid on the lungs.",
